{
  "id": "learning_aperture_gate",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "comment": "Emit seeds/learning_aperture_gate.json -- AN OBSERVATION REACHES THE LEARNER\nONLY IF ITS DIMENSION IS RESOLVED.\n\nThird occurrence of one shape, kept deliberately identical to the other two:\n\n  * `abg_gate_observation` gates a BELIEF's reality channel on the manifold\n    residual;\n  * `future_manifold.rs`'s aperture mask gates a PROJECTION's per-dimension\n    assessment;\n  * this gates a LEARNER's observation channel.\n\nMembership is read from graph data (`In(item.obs_dim, aff.stress_resolves_dims)`),\nnever a tuned coefficient.\n\nWhat makes this one alarming rather than merely symmetric: `lp_residual` computes\n`residual = |obs - held|`. An observation the agent cannot resolve arrives looking\nlike what it already predicted, so the residual is ZERO -- and zero is not \"I could\nnot tell\", it is the signal for \"I have mastered this\". A compressed learner is\ntherefore dropped from attention AS IF LEARNED.\n\n`obs_established` is written alongside so the two zeroes are at least separable by\nsomething. Nothing in `learning_progress_curiosity` reads it yet; that is the\nfinding, not the fix.\n\nPrereg: STRESS_COMPRESSES_APERTURE_PREREG.md addendum (block 366500).\n",
  "depends_on": [],
  "productions": [
    {
      "provenance": "seed:learning_aperture_gate:gates-attention",
      "src": {
        "type": "AffectiveState",
        "var": "aff"
      },
      "edge_type": "gates_attention",
      "tgt": {
        "type": "CuriosityHub",
        "var": "hub"
      }
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "lag_gate_observation",
      "comment": "The learner observes `obs_true` only in dimensions it can resolve. In a dimension it cannot, the observation is indistinguishable from its own held prediction -- so `obs` is set to `held`, which is exactly what an unresolvable difference looks like from inside. `obs_established` records which happened. Guarded on the current value so the fixpoint terminates.",
      "match": [
        [
          "aff",
          "gates_attention",
          "hub"
        ],
        [
          "hub",
          "has_attention_item",
          "item"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "Not",
        "arg": {
          "type": "And",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "item"
                },
                "key": "obs"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "IfThenElse",
                "cond": {
                  "type": "In",
                  "member": {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "item"
                    },
                    "key": "obs_dim"
                  },
                  "container": {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "aff"
                    },
                    "key": "stress_resolves_dims"
                  }
                },
                "then": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "item"
                  },
                  "key": "obs_true"
                },
                "other": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "item"
                  },
                  "key": "held"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "item"
                },
                "key": "obs_established"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "IfThenElse",
                "cond": {
                  "type": "In",
                  "member": {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "item"
                    },
                    "key": "obs_dim"
                  },
                  "container": {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "aff"
                    },
                    "key": "stress_resolves_dims"
                  }
                },
                "then": {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 1.0
                },
                "other": {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "item",
          "obs",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "IfThenElse",
              "cond": {
                "type": "In",
                "member": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "item"
                  },
                  "key": "obs_dim"
                },
                "container": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "aff"
                  },
                  "key": "stress_resolves_dims"
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "item"
                },
                "key": "obs_true"
              },
              "other": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "item"
                },
                "key": "held"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "item",
          "obs_established",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "IfThenElse",
              "cond": {
                "type": "In",
                "member": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "item"
                  },
                  "key": "obs_dim"
                },
                "container": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "aff"
                  },
                  "key": "stress_resolves_dims"
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 1.0
              },
              "other": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0.0
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
